{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787966254265362089,"compiled_state":{"alias":"prespinal-gem-kinkajou","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"c6e6927dac81d55f01033040169a54894dff6417161e4b2cd24b92accf984c6d","event_uuid":"6731880d-4a69-42f1-bd99-e3c41102dcb4","position":{"commit_sha":"ba1037a7bc89639db8399707110319ef69ceddfa","position":"1787963276401148001-6731880d-4a69-42f1-bd99-e3c41102dcb4"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"6a84285dc905aec9d4fa9348d471e1a2a79f1f35655e81df733e138f26dde257","event_uuid":"688730bd-1e22-4bfb-90b6-5fa01418d7ed","position":{"commit_sha":"f9b226c34e1d24c4f142b44fb5e9ea7abccb48f2","position":"1787963298442723001-688730bd-1e22-4bfb-90b6-5fa01418d7ed"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787963276401148001,"creation_channel":"python","deps":[{"link_uuid":"688730bd-1e22-4bfb-90b6-5fa01418d7ed","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"e1d9-4c8e-3fd1-41c2"}],"description":"## The defect\n\n`autodeploy.sh`'s mcp store-readiness gate (step 5b) calls `record_backoff_failure` on refusal,\nthe REVIEW-BOT backoff recorder, instead of `record_mcp_backoff_failure` used by every other\nfailure branch in the mcp block (`mcp-run-failed`, `mcp-unhealthy`, `mcp-flip-failed`).\n\n`record_backoff_failure` writes `$BACKOFF_FILE`, which gates the WHOLE script at the top, so a\nstoreless mcp container would suppress the review-bot deploy — a component that never ran on\nthat tick. `infra/scripts/autodeploy.sh:64-69` states that separation explicitly (\"writing it\nfrom the mcp path would let an mcp failure suppress the REVIEW-BOT deploy\"), and\n`MCP_BACKOFF_FILE` exists precisely to keep the two independent.\n\nFound by the plan-review gate while reviewing `vaccinated-flavorous-solenodon` (the startup\nMCP-handshake readiness gate), which was about to mirror step 5b verbatim and copy the defect.\nKept as its own ticket rather than folded in: it is a pre-existing, independently-verifiable\none-line fault in a different gate.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] The mcp store gate's failure branch calls `record_mcp_backoff_failure`, verified by a test\n      on the existing `mcp_box` harness asserting a refused storeless container writes\n      `mcp-deploy-backoff` and leaves `deploy-backoff` absent.\n","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["deploy","mcp"],"ticket_id":"dbf0-1fe5-8cc3-4d77","ticket_type":"bug","title":"The mcp store-readiness gate records the REVIEW-BOT backoff, throttling a component that never ran","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["6731880d-4a69-42f1-bd99-e3c41102dcb4","688730bd-1e22-4bfb-90b6-5fa01418d7ed"]},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787966254265362089,"uuid":"4c197757-0f1e-4a65-ae9e-9718da2d2bae"}